How to open virtual port 5 to listen TCA stream?/
Ans: Open new terminal and path to pocketSDR directory and run the command:
python3 - <<'PY'
import serial
ser = serial.Serial('/dev/pts/5', 500000, timeout=1)
print('Listening on /dev/pts/5...')
while True:
    line = ser.readline()
    if line:
        print(line.decode(errors='replace').rstrip())
PY

